# Event Payload Standard
- Schema chuẩn: eventVersion, eventType, eventId, timestamp, source, correlationId, actor, data, metadata
- Event Types: FileUploaded, UserCreated, DocumentProcessed, AutomationCompleted
- Implementation: Java dùng @EventListener, Python dùng Redis Pub/Sub

---

# Exception Handling
- Java: GlobalExceptionHandler → RestResponse với HTTP status 400/404/409/500
- Python: HTTPException hoặc RestResponse 500 với requestId, timestamp, path

---

# Tài liệu API
- Java: @Tag, @Operation, @RequestBody với schema
- Python: summary, description, tags nhất quán
- Luôn nêu rõ: URL, headers, payload, RestResponse